      "body_html": "<p style=\"text-align: center;\"><strong>Apart of a Limited Spring\u00a0RIZO\u00a0Drop...</strong></p>\n<p style=\"text-align: center;\"><span style=\"text-decoration: underline;\">Every Package comes with SPRING\u00a0Rizo Hoodie\u00a0...</span></p>\n<p style=\"text-align: center;\">\u00a08.5 oz Light\u00a0Weight Cotton</p>\n<p style=\"text-align: center;\">100% Combed ring-spun cotton</p>\n<p style=\"text-align: center;\">Soft Washed</p>\n<p style=\"text-align: center;\">Enhanced for Softness and Durability</p>\n<ul>\n<li style=\"text-align: left;\"><span style=\"font-size: 0.875rem;\">All Garments are Pre-shrunk but expect it to shrink up to 5 percent. We tend to only use; mostly stretchy but durable materials. This is to give our clothing more give/shape. This subtle stretch we strive for is why our clothing has a designer styled fitting. This makes our clothing ultimately comfortable and perfect for any gender or age without taking away from the quality.</span></li>\n</ul>\n<p>\u00a0</p>\n<h4 class=\"product-details__subhead\">Sizing Chart</h4>\n<p>\u00a0</p>\n<table class=\"sticky-enabled sticky-table\" role=\"presentation\" sticky=\"\">\n<thead class=\"tableHeader-processed\">\n<tr>\n<th>Sizes</th>\n<th>Body Width</th>\n<th>Sleeve Length</th>\n<th>Body Length</th>\n<th>Chest Width (laid Flat)</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody>\n<tr class=\"odd\">\n<td>Small</td>\n<td>20</td>\n<td>34.5</td>\n<td>29.5</td>\n<td>18</td>\n</tr>\n<tr class=\"even\">\n<td>Medium</td>\n<td>22</td>\n<td>35.5</td>\n<td>30.5</td>\n<td>20</td>\n</tr>\n<tr class=\"odd\">\n<td>Large</td>\n<td>24</td>\n<td>36.5</td>\n<td>31.5</td>\n<td>22</td>\n</tr>\n<tr class=\"even\">\n<td>Extra Large</td>\n<td>26</td>\n<td>37.5</td>\n<td>32.5</td>\n<td>24</td>\n</tr>\n<tr class=\"odd\">\n<td>2XL</td>\n<td>28</td>\n<td>38.5</td>\n<td>33.5</td>\n<td>26</td>\n</tr>\n<tr class=\"even\">\n<td>3XL</td>\n<td>30</td>\n<td>39</td>\n<td>34.5</td>\n<td>28</td>\n</tr>\n<tr class=\"odd\">\n<td>4XL</t